<title>USA: North Dakota Muni Bond Bank, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>North Dakota Muni Bond Bank, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $3.350 million of North Dakota Municipal Bond Bank, Taxable capital financing program bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 6.2943 percent.</p>
</text>
